with a footman.

153
00:10:59.031 --> 00:11:00.899
A Black footman?

154
00:11:00.934 --> 00:11:02.560
Well, evidently, yeah.

155
00:11:02.595 --> 00:11:05.431
Wow. I imagine
that was quite the scandal.

156
00:11:05.466 --> 00:11:07.664
She kept it a secret
from everyone,

157
00:11:07.699 --> 00:11:09.039
