158
00:11:09.074 --> 00:11:10.942
Quite the rebel,
your great-grandmother.

159
00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.913
So, what happened
to my grandfather?

160
00:11:14.948 --> 00:11:16.541
The baby.

161
00:11:16.576 --> 00:11:18.884
Turns out the footman
left the village

162
00:11:18.919 --> 00:11:22.547
