for a few days.

200
00:12:43.696 --> 00:12:44.970
Come on, say yes.

201
00:12:52.309 --> 00:12:54.144
<i>Hey, girl.
How's the motherland?</i>

202
00:12:54.179 --> 00:12:55.772
<i>You know, it feels good.</i>

203
00:12:55.807 --> 00:12:57.510
<i>I'm excited to meet my family.</i>

204
00:12:57.545 --> 00:12:59.809
<i>Oh, I'm excited for you.</i>

205
00:12:59.844 --> 00:13:01.646
<i>Now, what are the three rules?</i>

206
00:13:01.681 --> 00:13:04.220
Uh... Eat, pray, love?

207
00:13:04.255 --> 00:13:06.519
<i>Girl, if you wind up
dead in a ditch,</i>

208
00:13:06.554 --> 00:13:08.554
<i>I'm telling you,
I'm not helping.</i>

209
00:13:08.589 --> 00:13:12.558
Okay, okay. Send you a picture
