I'll call you later.

215
00:13:22.174 --> 00:13:24.669
<i>If you see Idris Elba,
say hi to him for me.</i>

216
00:13:24.704 --> 00:13:26.407
All right, bye.
Evie.

217
00:13:26.442 --> 00:13:27.540
