241
00:14:57.104 --> 00:14:58.104
Very sorry.

242
00:14:59.535 --> 00:15:01.469
Oh, please, miss,
we'll clean this up.

243
00:15:01.504 --> 00:15:04.978
It's okay. If we don't help
