469
00:30:17.023 --> 00:30:20.552
So many boys...

470
00:30:21.753 --> 00:30:23.423
we thought we were done for.

471
00:30:31.136 --> 00:30:32.564
Oh, uh...

472
00:30:32.599 --> 00:30:34.203
